###############################################################################
# PrintFlow Studio — privacy-first ignore rules
#
# Posture: DENY BY DEFAULT for anything that could carry customer artwork,
# production evidence, or workstation identity. Re-inclusions below are narrow
# and cover only synthetic, source-controlled assets.
#
# Authority: Epic 11100 plan §19.3; MVP design §19 (Privacy and Updates).
#
# NOTE ON ANCHORING: local runtime and evidence directory rules are anchored to
# the repository root with a leading slash. An unanchored rule matches at ANY
# depth, and because Git is case-insensitive on this workstation
# (core.ignorecase=true) rules like "Sessions/" and "preset/" silently excluded
# src/PrintFlow.Domain/Sessions/ and src/PrintFlow.Infrastructure/Preset/.
# The real evidence lives outside this repository under D:\PrintFlowStudio, so
# anchoring costs no protection — and the extension rules below still deny
# customer and production binaries at every depth.
###############################################################################

# --- .NET build output (any depth) ------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
TestResults/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# --- Local app configuration ------------------------------------------------
appsettings.local.json
*.local.json

# --- SQLite -----------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Production / customer image and design files (any depth) ---------------
*.atn
*.psd
*.psb
*.tif
*.tiff
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf

# --- Signed baseline evidence, by name (any depth) --------------------------
# Belt and braces for the Epic 11000 artifacts, which are plain .json and would
# otherwise not be caught by an extension rule.
printflow-workstation-*.json
workstation-preset-*.json
workstation.json
displays.json

# --- Local production evidence (repository root only) -----------------------
/signoff/
/preset/
/evidence/
/screenshots/
/Baseline/

# --- Local logs / runtime (repository root only) ----------------------------
/logs/
/Logs/
/Quarantine/
/Sessions/
/Working/
/Approved/
/Rejected/

# --- OS / editor noise ------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp

###############################################################################
# Narrow re-inclusions — SYNTHETIC, source-controlled assets only.
# Never add a re-inclusion for anything derived from customer work or from
# D:\PrintFlowStudio\Baseline.
###############################################################################
!src/PrintFlow.App/Assets/
!src/PrintFlow.App/Assets/*.png
!tests/PrintFlow.Tests/Fixtures/synthetic/
!tests/PrintFlow.Tests/Fixtures/synthetic/*.png
